// Authored slide complete-pose retargeting for the nine MP pilot roots.
//
// The 190-bone slide source rig is evaluated by the native client or server animation
// evaluator from pinned GAME assets, then retargeted onto the authored 223-bone male /
// 228-bone female pilot rigs. Only exact-profile pose consumers are detoured; activity
// selection and CalcMainActivity belong to movement_presentation_hooks.cpp. No prediction
// or simulation state is touched.
